  "step_3": "The information relevant to the decision reason — the aspiration levels (1250 for A, 1200 for B), the positive differences (1250 vs. 1200), and the probabilities of positive differences (33% vs. 34%) — is not mentioned or considered in the verbal report. The individual does not reference the mean of outcomes, nor do they discuss deviations from a central value. Instead, the justification is based only on the slightly higher probability of winning in Lottery B, without any reference to the aspiration level or the distribution of deviations. Therefore, the decision reason was not used in the deliberation process. The individual's reasoning is independent of the aspiration-level-based rule and relies on a different criterion (slight increase in probability).",
  "final_assessment_score": 0
